  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to expand access to Universal Health Coverage (UHC) across the Federated States of Micronesia (FSM), particularly targeting remote and outer-island communities where health outcomes remain poorest. It will upgrade and climate-proof rural dispensaries into functional community health centers, equip them with renewable energy and digital connectivity, and introduce telehealth services to bridge gaps in access to doctors and specialists. At the same time, the project will address</narrative>
